      "key": "birthday_letter",
      "visible": true,
      "content": {
        "heading": "Happy Birthday, Jeriann Alexa",
        "opening": "For you, on your birthday.",
        "body": {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "What started as conversations on social media became something I never expected to mean this much to me. From waiting for you by Lawson to our Chick Chicken dates and that evening in Tagaytay, I’m grateful for every little moment that brought us here."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "I thought I already knew how to love. Being with you showed me that I still had so much to learn. Love isn’t only the butterflies—it’s learning to understand each other, working through difficult days, and growing together."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "I love how caring you are, your wonderfully weird and funny side, and your kindness. You’re the kindest person I know, and I hope you feel just as cared for as you make me feel."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "On your birthday, I wish you happiness, peace, and more reasons to smile. I want to be there to celebrate your good days and listen when things feel heavy."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "I will keep choosing you, even when life gets messy. I’ll care for you in every way I can, keep learning how to love you better, and do my part to help us grow."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "signature": "With all my love,\nJalebong",
        "date": "2026-10-09"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "final_closing",
      "visible": true,
      "content": {
        "message": {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Still you. Always you."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Through ordinary days and difficult ones, I want to be beside you. I will keep choosing you, Jeriann Alexa."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "date": "2026-10-09"
      }
    }
